- crates/cli/src/subscription.rs:244-285 — Shows subprocess creation, stdout/stderr sibling tasks, deadline handling, process-tree kill, and failure propagation.
- crates/cli/src/subscription.rs:668-706 — Shows the focused success/usage-metadata and fast-timeout test cases.

